Maria H.: Also ensure pagination example shows cursor handling: small psuedo-example for Python:```python
def list_items(client):
    cursor = None
    while True:
        res = client.items.list(cursor=cursor, limit=100)
        for it in res.items: yield it
        if not res.next_cursor: break
        cursor = res.next_cursor
```
